{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:03 2026-10-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:03 2026-10-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:03 2026-10-30 HKT</p><img alt=\"房署轄下地盤有工人下巴插鐵支受傷送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c58ea81f37f5e57ac44626e0bffd87a/2026-10/2_0_31.jpeg\"/><p>上水清曉路18號一個地盤對開，今（30日）早上10時50分，一名男工人工作期間，報稱失平衡跌倒，被鐵枝插下巴，消防到場營救，將他救出，惟下顎仍插著鐵支一併送威爾斯親王醫院治理。</p><p>現場為房屋署轄下地盤，正進行地基工程，插有大量鋼筋。警方將事件列工業意外，勞工處及警方跟進調查。</p><img alt=\"傷者送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ddb77cb0762773f35050342060ed1a4/2026-10/02_53.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場插滿鋼筋。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e3c2f622bfa4b6a0869f7e1b1b7e8302/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_12_34_16.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場有大批鋼筋。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f769a3892fb524fb01b2e86ad048ac41/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_12_34_20.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為房委會地盤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e301670e8738ebe496396260a33f559/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_12_34_19.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80660405f5e754145ef57e5b2f54a924/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_12_34_15.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e1107e4a95c1cf96817a72e3ea11246c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_12_30_11.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a09b98a21acc222717f7cb467ed1541/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_12_34_12_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:05:32.728439+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T04:03:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:00:32.695276+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:00:17.270388+00:00","content_hash":"4a0566c0877d7c6ae7cef60aea0bb71cb01f17f622646539a4d99760bdfb8135","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retentio